{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your numbers up in this Top down Collectathon Target Practice Shooter - One miss and you lose the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenge</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim and shoot at the target and jewels come out, shoot the jewels before they fall too far to collect them and increase your money and points in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More points and jewels are given the further you shoot a target.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship moves around automatically, you aim at target with Mouse/Touch or by rotating the ship to aim at the target (with Keyboard or Controller).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The target gets smaller the more targets that you shoot to make it more challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One miss and you lose the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.poster.avif?t=1768593449\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.webm?t=1768593449\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/28b7bb5da65f263f8079dbdd8c9248f3.mp4?t=1768593449\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a skill based game, where your reaction and aim are tested. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get better at aiming the more that you play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The better you get at aiming the more fun it is as you see your numbers going up fast as you get more money, points and targets hit.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse/Touch, Keyboard or Controller (Works with Xbox Controller and untested on other gamepads)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the color of your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612520/extras/b5ec1c726c7fed5471c7a787819c3ec4.avif?t=1768593449\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements for progress.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High score</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try and beat your high scores including number of targets hit, number of points and money from the jewels that you collect. Watch as your numbers go up.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Starting Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612520/e0bc87d2888b400401ae479b5e8e26f28b33732d.jpg"},{"name":"Good progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612520/874f0c219b13200aedd5e7a828e9574a5eedf321.jpg"},{"name":"Skills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612520/80276fad0654131f4ef15b5fcdbce8d660265aed.jpg"},{"name":"Can't miss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612520/557bf363531db2dc97c211a15c7fe99805553392.jpg"},{"name":"Century","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612520/421f8050f7d687ad7ede4bda5d5b797ab4a3825b.jpg"},{"name":"Big Numbers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612520/7edae8407220f464cafab411a72eb44a9